# Witness: a read through a reference to an int gives its value (seen 5).
# Norm: the book #scope, journal 2026-11-17 #l3-own-types.
# Slice C1 (plan #one-graph-plan, P1): the check lives in src/l2src/lmx_checks.lm2.
(
    Observed:
        int: seen 0
)
sub: main () (
    int: x 5
    @: q int @x
    int: k 0
)
    @: shared node[0]
    k := \q
    shared\Observed\seen := k
main()
